{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-6eff3192-3a42-4065-84a2-15054b125434","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5d0b99dd4d35448","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-8007-55wpkne0/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-8007-E002.md","content":"# UXD design for Feature Store admin UI (wizard, list, detail, delete)\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the UX design assets for the Feature Store admin management surface in the RHOAI dashboard: wireframes and interaction patterns for the guided create wizard, the management list page, the read-only instance detail view, and the delete confirmation dialog. The designs are the artifact the dashboard frontend implementation builds against, and use the validated engineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) as the starting design reference.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the guided create form wizard: namespace selection, registry type, online store backend, offline store backend, authorization mode, and scaling parameters, with inline validation guidance patterns for CRD schema constraints.\n- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the management list page: instance rows showing name, namespace, deployment status, and creation timestamp; inspect and delete actions; status presentation for the deploying-to-ready progression.\n- Wireframes for the read-only instance detail/inspect view (backends, authorization mode, scaling, TLS status, materialization schedule, deployment conditions).\n- Interaction design for the delete confirmation dialog.\n- Viewer (non-admin) variant of the list and detail views: read-only presentation with no create or delete controls.\n- Disconnected/air-gapped constraint: designs must reference only assets bundled in the dashboard's static build — no external resource fetches.\n- Design review iterations with product management and dashboard engineering, culminating in a signed-off design spec.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Finalized, reviewed wireframes exist for the create wizard covering all required fields: namespace, registry type, online store backend, offline store backend, authorization mode, and scaling configuration.\n- Finalized, reviewed wireframes exist for the management list page, read-only detail view, and delete confirmation dialog.\n- The viewer (non-admin) read-only variant is specified, with no create or delete controls presented.\n- Inline validation and error-presentation patterns for form constraints are specified.\n- The design spec passes formal UXD review and is signed off for implementation.\n- No design element depends on fetching external network resources at runtime.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables HLR-1 through HLR-5 (P0 — the UI surfaces the frontend implements).\n- Enables HLR-6 (P1 — viewer read-only variant) and HLR-8 (P2 — inline validation guidance patterns).\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- The `needs-uxd` label is queued with no design sprint scheduled yet; the strategy directs engaging UXD immediately and using the prototype as the starting reference to avoid blocking.\n- Wizard field-level wireframes may need one refinement iteration once the recommended TP field set (from the FeatureStore CRD validation work) is finalized; the two efforts run in parallel by design.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52009,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-866fdf02f8c7596b","agent_id":"a91c29e841bf56c68","session_id":"f4ee95a6-a773-43fc-83d6-721cce8a6ac9","uuid":"b9e1c48e-ae3f-4a93-93b3-02f9ad1dbe80","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:11:35.110Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007 into epics"}
